  "prefLabel": "Diet 401.05 Trimester course",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Diet 401.05 “Trimester course” means a college or university course, the duration of which is one-third of the institution’s academic year.\n\nSource. #7938, eff 8-23-03; ss by #8336, eff 5-1-05, EXPIRED: 5-1-13\n\nNew. #10691, eff 10-9-14; ss by #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35 (formerly Diet 401.06)",
